/P 112 0 R
/T (Our project transforms standard radio into a Secure & Reliable Packet-Switched System capable of guaranteeing delivery in noisy environments. By building a custom protocol in GNU Radio, we integrated ARQ for reliability, AES encryption for security, and Priority Scheduling to ensure 'Code Red' alerts always cut through the traffic. This system provides dispatchers with a resilient, modern tool for critical communication.)
